ense of fulfillment and and  felt like what i was doing is really  helping people and that really spoke to  what i wanted to do is my next call in i  guess and so even in my day-to-day life  i wake up i get your emails I get your  comments on YouTube I get your facebook  comments and that makes me happy you  know I love seeing that we're having an  impact and that helping people stay  motivated their business and give them  ideas to help them grow their business  and it's it's a it's a deeper sense of  happiness I guess so the first one was  was such a high very acute and something  that you chase I guess and I don't think  I've necessarily gotten to that point  with with my current business but I wake  up a lot more fulfilled very happy about  what I do and feeling that I'm really  helping people and so I guess is a  different kind of happiness and I'm not  really chasing that big guy because I  enjoy what I do every day helping  entrepreneurs so two-part answer to your  question hopefully that helped for those  of you watching if you liked it please  give it a thumbs up below makes me want  to do more of these for you and if you  have a comment on this video if you  liked the video or not and or if you  want to ask me a question but your  business I'd love to be able to try to  answer it for you if you want to leave  it in the comment section below so thank  you and I'll see you in the next episode  you  bye
 

